    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a soldier in Spain in 1938. You must infiltrate the enemy's territory to retrieve sensitive information. It is an infiltration mission that awakens memories in an old woman who claims to be losing her memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this &quot;Walking Simulator&quot;\u00a0game you will find puzzles in which the solution lies in knowing how to find your way through a town hall destroyed by war. Through keys and maps scatered arround the building you will advance and discover the story that is told to the player through the messages written on a typewriter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503720/extras/17f85c518beb0f509a50580aab920fba.avif?t=1748362742\" data-has-big width=800 height=367 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These messages are the letters sent to each other by Juan and Ant\u00f3n, the protagonists of the story. In these you can see how the war has affected them, what their true relationship truly is. The letters show the things they did not share and only the two of them experienced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503720/extras/46f086008d3b338d52e127a3c860338e.avif?t=1748362742\" data-has-big width=800 height=379 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive environment of a town hall in the Spanish Civil War.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Linear love story that tells you about the relationship between two men before, during and after a war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Puzzles that are solved thanks to the player's ability to orient themselves and read maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In-game cinematics about the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a soldier in Spain in 1938. You must infiltrate the enemy's territory to retrieve sensitive information. It is an infiltration mission that awakens memories in an old woman who claims to be losing her memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this &quot;Walking Simulator&quot;\u00a0game you will find puzzles in which the solution lies in knowing how to find your way through a town hall destroyed by war. Through keys and maps scatered arround the building you will advance and discover the story that is told to the player through the messages written on a typewriter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503720/extras/17f85c518beb0f509a50580aab920fba.avif?t=1748362742\" data-has-big width=800 height=367 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These messages are the letters sent to each other by Juan and Ant\u00f3n, the protagonists of the story. In these you can see how the war has affected them, what their true relationship truly is. The letters show the things they did not share and only the two of them experienced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503720/extras/46f086008d3b338d52e127a3c860338e.avif?t=1748362742\" data-has-big width=800 height=379 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive environment of a town hall in the Spanish Civil War.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Linear love story that tells you about the relationship between two men before, during and after a war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Puzzles that are solved thanks to the player's ability to orient themselves and read maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In-game cinematics about the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
